flowchart TD
  A[Draft or workflow request] --> B[Check tenant sender recipients]
  B --> C{Policy allows?}
  C -- No --> D[Save draft with denial reason]
  C -- Yes --> E[Persist intent and idempotency key]
  E --> F[Dispatch to provider]
  F --> G{Receipt certain?}
  G -- No --> H[Mark UNKNOWN and reconcile]
  G -- Yes --> I[Record acceptance and audit]
